Feature Engg
-->Feature Transformation
----------> Feature Scaling
----------> Encoding Categorical


Data 
-> numerical 
-> categorical
    -> Nomial (there is not relationship between data) 
               i.e. : Branch in engg 
    In Nomial you apply One hot encoding
    
   [ex of one hot encoding : male Female , yes no]

    -> ordinal (when there is relationship between data)
     => In ordinal you apply ORDINAL Encoding


Label encoding -> similar as ordinal encoding
--> Label encoding is for the output not for input

---> when there is ordinal encoding output  then you cannot  apply ordinal
encoding , there you have to apply lable encoding


example of ordinal encoder: OrdinalEncoder(categories=[['Poor','Average','Good'],['School','UG','PG']])
